# Finding Frank in the Observatory's cells (Milestone 20c, escape start).
# Plays on stepping onto the rune in front of his cell.

face player up
emote frank !
say Frank: Oh, thank the Light - somebody's awake! You there, the mage. Get me out of here?
narrate The lock is sealed with a sigil of void energy. A careful flicker of flame, and it unravels.
face frank down
say Frank: Frank. Just Frank. A traveling merchant - or I was, before they dragged me in here with the rest of their... collection.
emote player ?
say Frank: The way out runs past the great lens, and there's a thing standing guard there. Stone and void, no mind behind it at all.
say Frank: Blades just skip off that shell - but it looked mighty uneasy near the braziers. And when it starts drawing the dark in, brace yourself.
set met_frank
narrate Frank falls in behind you.
despawn frank
